IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. T. ENVIRONMENT DIVISION. INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION. FILE-CONTROL. SELECT F ASSIGN TO 'a'. DATA DIVISION. FILE SECTION. FD F GLOBAL. 01 R PIC X. PROCEDURE DIVISION. CALL 'S1'. STOP RUN. IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. S1. PROCEDURE DIVISION. DISPLAY 'OK'.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING 'OK' DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "OK"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [OK] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF. EXIT PROGRAM. END PROGRAM S1.

